---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /india/blog/
title: "Financial Planning Blog – CalcPhi"
description: "In-depth guides on SIP, EMI, income tax, mutual funds, retirement, and personal finance for India. Practical advice with real numbers — no jargon, no fluff."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Home
    url: /
  - name: Blog
---

<main id="main-content">
  <div class="hub-hero">
    <div class="hub-hero__inner">
      <h1>Financial Planning Blog</h1>
      <p>Plain-English guides to help you make smarter financial decisions — with real numbers, not vague advice. Written by CFAs, CAs, and CFPs with India-specific context.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hub-content">
    <div class="blog-grid">

      {% for post in collections.indiaBlog %}
        {% set slug = post.url | replace("/india/blog/", "") | replace("/", "") %}
        {% set meta = india.blogMeta[slug] %}
        {% if meta %}
        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-card__meta">
            <span class="blog-card__tag">{{ meta.category }}</span>
            <span class="blog-card__date">{{ post.data.datePublished | monthYear }}</span>
            {% if post.data.dateModified and post.data.dateModified != post.data.datePublished %}
            <span class="blog-card__updated">Updated {{ post.data.dateModified | monthYear }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ meta.cardTitle }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ meta.cardSummary }}</p>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card__read">Read article →</a>
        </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

    </div>
  </div>
</main>
